{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "Teleport identity & access dashboard. Who is authenticating, what certificates are being issued, and is anything anomalous? Suitable for security teams and customer-success / SE demos.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [
    {
      "asDropdown": false,
      "icon": "external link",
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": false,
      "tags": [],
      "targetBlank": true,
      "title": "Teleport Metrics Reference",
      "tooltip": "",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://goteleport.com/docs/reference/monitoring/metrics/"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 100,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Authentication",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "${DS_TELEPORT_BACKEND}"
      },
      "description": "Successful vs failed logins per hour, counted from `user.login` events in the Teleport audit log.\n\nSourced from the audit log rather than Prometheus deliberately. `failed_login_attempts_total` is exported only by the proxy and SSH-node roles, never by auth \u2014 so it never increments for SSO or web login failures. It read 0 on every instance while the audit log held 27 failed logins all-time. `user_login_total` is also not a login counter: it counts re-authentications / session refreshes and over-reports roughly 5x (266 increments vs 52 audit `user.login` successes over the same window).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "noValue": "No logins in window",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Failed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "red",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Success"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "green",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "sum",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "postgres",
            "uid": "${DS_TELEPORT_BACKEND}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "time_series",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT date_trunc('hour', event_time) AS time,\n  count(*) FILTER (WHERE event_data->>'success'='true')  AS \"Success\",\n  count(*) FILTER (WHERE event_data->>'success'='false') AS \"Failed\"\nFROM public.events\nWHERE event_type='user.login'\n  AND event_time >= $__timeFrom() AND event_time <= $__timeTo()\nGROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Logins per Hour, Success vs Failure (audit log)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "x-requires": [
        "audit.postgres"
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "${DS_TELEPORT_BACKEND}"
      },
      "description": "Share of `user.login` audit events that succeeded, over the dashboard time range.\n\nAn empty window reads \"No logins in window\" against a neutral background rather than red. The previous Prometheus version divided increase(user_login_total[24h]) by increase(user_login_total[24h]) + increase(failed_login_attempts_total[24h]); on an idle cluster both terms were 0, the result was NaN, and NaN fell through to the base threshold and rendered red \u2014 a permanent false alarm.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "noValue": "No logins in window",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.9
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.95
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showPercentChange": false,
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "postgres",
            "uid": "${DS_TELEPORT_BACKEND}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT count(*) FILTER (WHERE event_data->>'success'='true')::float\n       / NULLIF(count(*), 0) AS \"Login Success\"\nFROM public.events\nWHERE event_type='user.login'\n  AND event_time >= $__timeFrom() AND event_time <= $__timeTo()",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Login Success Ratio (selected window)",
      "type": "stat",
      "x-requires": [
        "audit.postgres"
      ]
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "id": 101,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Certificate Issuance",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Rate of user certificates issued by Teleport auth (`teleport_user_certificates_generated`).\n\nOn this cluster this traffic is essentially all MachineID/bot renewal, not human login: the audit log shows 288 `cert.create` and 144 `bot.join` events per day (exactly 2 certs per bot join) against 2 human `user.login` events in 30 days, and the Prometheus counter's 24h increase (286) matches the `cert.create` rate. Read it as bot renewal volume; use the audit-sourced login panels above for human activity.\n\nThe `auth_generate_requests_total` series was removed: it read 10 for all time and 0 over 7d, so it drew a flat zero underneath a series it claims to be a superset of.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(teleport_user_certificates_generated{namespace=~\"$namespace\",job=~\"$teleport_job\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "User certs issued (mostly MachineID/bot renewal)",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "User Certificate Issuance Rate (bot-dominated)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "x-requires": [
        "prometheus"
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "P95/P99 latency of `auth.Generate` calls, gated on sample volume: the quantile is only drawn when more than 20 observations landed in the trailing hour. Sustained > 1s usually means the backend is slow.\n\nThe gate matters here \u2014 `auth_generate_seconds_count` is 10 for the entire lifetime of this cluster and 0 over 24h. Without it the quantile is NaN and a single slow call snaps P99 to a bucket edge and reads as a latency spike. \"insufficient samples\" is the honest answer.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "noValue": "insufficient samples",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(auth_generate_seconds_bucket{namespace=~\"$namespace\",job=~\"$teleport_job\"}[1h])) by (le)) and on() (sum(increase(auth_generate_seconds_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\",job=~\"$teleport_job\"}[1h])) > 20)",
          "legendFormat": "P95",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(auth_generate_seconds_bucket{namespace=~\"$namespace\",job=~\"$teleport_job\"}[1h])) by (le)) and on() (sum(increase(auth_generate_seconds_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\",job=~\"$teleport_job\"}[1h])) > 20)",
          "legendFormat": "P99",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Cert Issuance Latency (P95/P99, >20 samples/h)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "x-requires": [
        "prometheus"
      ]
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "id": 102,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Sessions & Connections",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Active SSH sessions, broken out per Prometheus `job` (Teleport role).\n\n`proxy_ssh_sessions_total` is a GAUGE despite the `_total` suffix (metadata-confirmed: \"Number of active sessions through this proxy\") \u2014 do not wrap it in rate() or increase(). It is exported by every Teleport process, so a single live session traversing proxy -> node is counted once by each and a bare sum() double-counts it. Splitting `by (job)` makes that visible instead of silently doubling the number.\n\nSSH only: kube, db, app and desktop sessions are not covered by this metric.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (job) (proxy_ssh_sessions_total{namespace=~\"$namespace\",job=~\"$teleport_job\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Active SSH Sessions by Role (gauge, counted once per role)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "x-requires": [
        "prometheus"
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Agent reverse-tunnel connections terminating on the proxies, from `teleport_authenticated_active_connections`.\n\nThe old title said \"by Type\", but `ingress_service` carries exactly one value on this metric cluster-wide (`tunnel`, only on job=\"teleport\"), so there is nothing to break out. These are agents dialling back to the proxy \u2014 node, kube, app, db and the MachineID bots \u2014 not interactive user connections. A drop here means an agent has disconnected; it is not a measure of user activity. Series are split `by (job, ingress_service)` so a second value would appear if one ever showed up.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "normal"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 19
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (job, ingress_service) (teleport_authenticated_active_connections{namespace=~\"$namespace\",job=~\"$teleport_job\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} / {{ingress_service}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Agent Reverse-Tunnel Connections (not user sessions)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "x-requires": [
        "prometheus"
      ]
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "id": 103,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "API (gRPC)",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Top gRPC methods by request rate. Useful for spotting noisy clients or runaway loops.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "normal"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (grpc_method) (rate(grpc_server_handled_total{namespace=~\"$namespace\",job=~\"$teleport_job\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{grpc_method}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Top 10 gRPC Methods (RPC/sec)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "x-requires": [
        "prometheus"
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Fraction of gRPC responses that are not `OK`, split so that no code is hidden.\n\nThe old query filtered out `NotFound` entirely and read a flat green 0%, while `NotFound` was 1,965 of 10,529 RPCs per day (18.6%) \u2014 a `NotFound` storm, the classic symptom of a broken cache or a resource being polled after deletion, could never surface. All three series are now drawn:\n\n- **Error rate (excl. NotFound)** \u2014 colours the panel against the 1% / 5% thresholds. Baseline `NotFound` chatter is normal on an idle Teleport cluster and would otherwise pin this permanently red.\n- **NotFound rate** \u2014 drawn neutral so a storm is plainly visible without firing the threshold.\n- **All non-OK rate** \u2014 `grpc_code!~\"OK|Canceled\"`, the true total.\n\n`Canceled` is excluded throughout: long-lived `WatchEvents` streams end that way by design.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line+area"
            }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
